{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 2180,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Imagine this is an hydrogen atom."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4420,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This, is another one,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5780,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then this is H2, the hydrogen molecule."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9500,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can break it apart, add an oxygen atom and make H2O—water."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14880,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A carbon with four hydrogens, that is methane."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17800,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you can actually combine it with water to make: methanol."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21860,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are Snatoms, The Magnetic Molecular Modeling Kit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25580,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I am Derek Muller, the creator of a Youtube channel called Veritasium,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29040,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which has nearly 3 million suscribers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31560,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Through my videos, I teach science virtually to millions of people around the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36280,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But some things are best learned hands-on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38800,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like chemistry. I mean, atoms are impossible to see"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42240,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and chemical notation can be very confusing for students."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45300,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that is why, as a teacher for 7 years before I started Veritasium,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48780,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've always wished that something like this existed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51920,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Snatoms are an improvement over ball-and-stick models for three reasons:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55640,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "1) They're quicker to put together and break apart,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58780,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "2) Plus, they're a better representation of what a molecule actually looks like."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62240,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, bonds are not sticks. They are overlapping electron orbitals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66240,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "3) And most important, Snatoms allow you to feel the attraction between atoms."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70600,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that helps break the misconception that bonds store energy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74220,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is something that I talked to Hank Green about on SciShow Talk Show."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77580,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: Where is the energy coming from?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79440,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hank: The bonds, man."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80720,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: But my concern is this, right? If you think that there really is energy in bonds,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84660,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hank: Yup."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85920,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: Then you would imagine something like breaking those bonds open"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88880,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "releases that energy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90380,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hank: Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90880,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: Which is totally false!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 91920,
    "dDurationMs": 1060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hank: That is true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92980,
    "dDurationMs": 1420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: This is my point!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94400,
    "dDurationMs": 660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(laughter)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95100,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: It's the formation of bonds that releases energy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97200,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's the breaking of bonds which takes energy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99640,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With Snatoms, you can easily feel the work you need to do to break a bond, and you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104300,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can hear the energy released when a new bond forms. [click]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107480,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've been developing Snatoms for over two years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110500,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The first prototypes I made out of Styrofoam balls that I cut and put magnets in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115700,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You may have seen this picture on my Instagram."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118100,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then I made drawings for the project and had them 3D printed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120840,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then I created some injection molded prototypes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123280,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which I spray-painted and used in my video ''5 Fun Physics Phenomena''"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 126820,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now I need your help to make this project a reality."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130180,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Veritasium has showed me that there are millions of people out there passionate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133620,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about helping others understand science."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 135820,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you agree with me that this would help and Snatoms should exist in the world,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139920,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then help me fund the production molds and magnets required to make this happen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 144000,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A basic Snatoms kit would include"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145680,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "6 carbon atoms, 6 oxygens"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147780,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and 12 hydrogens."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149640,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's all the atoms you need to make glucose, the basic sugar molecule."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152880,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But of course with this building blocks you can build"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154880,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hundreds of other molecules."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156580,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I will make some video guides explaining how to use Snatoms"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160060,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to learn about molecules, chemical bonding, geometry"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163620,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and balancing equations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165680,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, if we reach a stretch target I will add another element to the kit,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169580,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like nitrogen. Plus if we reach a further stretch target I will build an app"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174020,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that will gamify the process of learning, allowing users to learn"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176480,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about new molecules and capture their progress."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179680,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think the best way to learn science is hands-on from a young age,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 183180,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and if you want to help me make this happen, then support this Kickstarter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187360,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You don't have to buy a set of Snatoms (though that definitely would help)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190200,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if you think is a good idea just share it with your friends on Twitter or Facebook."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194160,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I really appreciate your support and I look forward to helping the world"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197380,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "learn science physically in addition to through the internet."
    } ]
  } ]
}
